From 18a7ffb01ad850e07a10bba681e0ed2eb462f058 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: manumuxoz <manuel.munhozvazquez@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:16:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(party): add host-authoritative collaborative queue

- core queue model with current/items/history, permissions, limits and tests
- protocol v2: queue snapshots, patches, commands, acks and resync
- host/guest network integration with chunking and idempotency
- TUI queue in the party popup and the existing Queue screen
- relay v2 for Cloudflare Workers and a Rust self-hosted relay
